= Berserker / Monk / Rogue Guide =

Hello there! This guide seeks to help you *blender your way to victory.* Asterisk

= Overview =

This class combo presents some interesting challenges and niche strengths (especially powerful in Duos) enabled by some friendly buffs and a full-melee approach, assuming your gear and stance-dance game is on point.


